# HomeLab Challenges Faced

The **Makani HomeAuto HomeLab** was intentionally built as an engineering validation environment.

That means failures, configuration mistakes, integration gaps, and unexpected platform behavior are not treated as incidental problems.

They are part of the design process.

The HomeLab troubleshooting model is:

```text
Problem
