     â”‚
     â–¼
Virtualization Layer
     â”‚
     â–¼
Ubuntu VM
     â”‚
     â–¼
/dev/video*
     â”‚
     â–¼
Frigate Container
```

## Diagnosis

Ubuntu:

```bash
ls -l /dev/video*
```

```bash
v4l2-ctl --list-devices
```

Inside Frigate:

```bash
