Combining Lab and Production indicators into one generic monitoring view made the operational state unclear.

## Resolution

The portal monitoring design was changed to represent:

```text
Lab Environment
```

and:

```text
Production Environment
```

as separate summary widgets.

Detailed information can then be shown when the user selects an environment/service.

## Engineering Lesson

> **Environment boundaries should remain visible in monitoring interfaces.**

Lab health and Production health should never be visually conflated.

