# 37. Example â€” Service Failure

If Frigate has a problem:

```bash
./dockerctl status frigate frigate
```

Then:

```bash
./dockerctl logs frigate frigate
```

If required:

```bash
./dockerctl restart frigate frigate
```

Do not immediately run:

```bash
./dockerctl restart-all
```

